<title>UK: DSM sets 300 million guilder 10-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>DSM sets 300 million guilder 10-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSM NV</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DFL   COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    11.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.855   PAY DATE    11.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.28     SPREAD	+52 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    AMSTERDAM PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-10	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  NETHS     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.425     SELL CONC  1.575     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.50 PCT 2006 DSL / 8.75 PCT 2007 DSL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
